{
  "_comment": [
    "Sieve — Game Blocker: curated, STATIC domain lists (like dating-sites.json).",
    "Four INDEPENDENT groups, each with its own toggle and its own DNR ID band, so",
    "a user can block browser game portals without touching Steam, or vice versa.",
    "Scope is deliberately BROWSER-ONLY: an extension cannot see installed games,",
    "consoles, or native launchers. Blocking a store's website does not uninstall or",
    "stop a game that is already on the machine.",
    "Editing this file + reloading the extension rebuilds the rules (no fetch, no",
    "scheduler). requestDomains matches each domain AND all its subdomains.",
    "The shared Allowlist (priority 2, ID 20000) overrides every rule built here."
  ],

